OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACanada stops using 'avalanche dogs' for
OL,4,Arescues in Rocky Mountains, stirring
OL,5,Aoutrage
OL,6,
OL,7,FScott Ward can still recall the relief
OL,8,Fhe saw on parents' faces when a search
OL,9,Fand rescue dog he was working with
OL,10,Ffound their children safe in Canada's
OL,11,Fvast and heavily wooded Banff National
OL,12,FPark.
OL,14,FAnother time, his canine partner led
OL,15,Fhim hiking up a steep mountainside for
OL,16,Ftwo hours until they reached a man with
OL,17,Fa broken leg who was close to dying
OL,18,Ffrom hypothermia.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
