OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACanada stops using 'avalanche dogs' for
OL,4,Arescues in Rocky Mountains, stirring
OL,5,Aoutrage
OL,6,
OL,7,FNow 73 and retired, Ward spent 17 years
OL,8,Fas a dog handler in the wilderness of
OL,9,Fthe Canadian Rocky Mountains, work he
OL,10,Fdescribed as gratifying.
OL,12,FOver the years, the rescue programme
OL,13,Fwas cut back to just one person in the
OL,14,Frole, and Ward was shocked when he
OL,15,Fheard recently that Parks Canada will
OL,16,Fend the programme entirely as of this
OL,17,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
